//   rest as OTHER MATERIALS IN SPACE (atmosphere only).
// - SURFACE directive in all 3 interior-driven overrides (insitu_interior, pullback_table,
//   human_element) now points to TABLETOP MATERIAL specifically, with explicit guidance
//   that OTHER MATERIALS IN SPACE must NOT drive the table surface.
// - Long-term fix is at Vision ingest (dedicated tabletop_material field in the response
