//
// v3.3 (carried forward):
// - pullback_table = abundance / restaurant-marketing spread
// - insitu_interior tightened to clean dish-in-venue
// - HARD source-dish preservation language across all 5 reference-using variants
// - Prescriptive surface directives in hero_moody and topdown_props
//
