// - human_element editorial elevation with 3 locked scenarios (chef / server / diner)
//
// v3.1 (carried forward):
// - Style-ref selection (sortByRecency + active newest) and composeStyleSceneBlock
// - 5 of 8 variants reference-driven:
//     - hero_moody       (style-driven)
